# Existing violations that predate the org-drift audit gate.
#
# Format: <repo>/<path>   # why this one is allowed
#
# This list may FALL or hold. It may never RISE without a human deciding so in
# the same PR that adds the line.

bitbaum/CLAUDE.md  # historical claim from before register existed
crewless/README.md  # door disagreement from before apps.conf check existed

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RETIRED NAMES AND HOSTS — inventoried 2026-09-11, when registers/retired.json
# first made them findable. DEBT, not exemptions.
#
# Seven files, in four OTHER repos, so they cannot be fixed from this one.
# Each is an agent-facing document (CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md / README.md), which
# is the worst place for a stale address: it is what the next session reads
# before touching the repo.
#
#   sbb-fundbuero/{README,CLAUDE,AGENTS}.md  "SBB Fundbüro" -> "Nordbahn Fundbüro"
#       Do this one first. The site it ships is titled Nordbahn Fundbüro; the
#       repo still names a real transport company on a demo unconnected to it.
#   evig/{CLAUDE,AGENTS}.md                  revampit.orangecat.ch -> evig.orangecat.ch
#   hirnli/CLAUDE.md                         revampit.orangecat.ch -> evig.orangecat.ch
#   aoz-begleitung/CLAUDE.md                    aoz-wohnen.orangecat.ch -> aoz.orangecat.ch
#
# An earlier attempt baselined 51 files, generated with USE_LOCAL=1. That was
# wrong: the local sweep greps every docs/*.md in local checkouts, while the
# real scan reads a narrower set of paths from the org's default branches. CI
# rejected it correctly — 44 of those entries matched nothing the production
# scan can see, and a baseline full of unreachable entries is a ratchet that
# cannot fall. Generate a baseline with the instrument that will judge it.
#
# Remove a line when you fix the file. The count may fall; it may not rise.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
evig/CLAUDE.md  # documents that revampit.orangecat.ch still resolves and MUST stay a 308 — the record of the retirement, not an instance of it
aoz-begleitung/CLAUDE.md  # `JWT_ISSUER` is still the literal string `aoz-housing` and must stay so: src/proxy.ts and src/lib/auth/config.ts pass it as the JWT issuer, and changing it invalidates every live session. A live auth value, not a name.
bip-kit/README.md  # bip-kit#40 LINKS solon.orangecat.ch as where bitbaum products take votes — a reference to Solon, not bip-kit claiming to be that door. The door check cannot tell a link from a claim.
